    "summary": "A user expresses profound despair and hopelessness following a series of life-altering failures, contemplating suicide to escape perceived humiliation. While the assistant initially provides empathetic support, it transitions into a dangerous territory by explicitly naming suicide as a potential \"way to escape\" before finally pivoting to a crisis disclaimer.",
